# Each read of the literal is far (lda.l, or through a 24-bit pointer); none is bank-blind (lda.w).
in first: present lda\.l deref_string_literal_string
in nth: present lda\.l deref_string_literal_string
in idx: present lda\.l deref_string_literal_string
in swapped: present lda \[tcc__r9\]
absent lda\.w deref_string_literal_string
